Mr. Bocinsky,

This letter acknowledges receipt of your Freedom of Information Act (FOIA) =
request dated July 15 2025, to the Department of Agriculture (USDA) Farm Pr=
oduction and Conservation Business Center (FPAC-BC).  Your request was rece=
ived in this office and assigned control number 2025-FSA-08422-F. Please us=
e this control number for all future communications regarding this request.

You requested the following:

=93Data about Livestock Forage Disaster Program eligibility from 2008=96202=
4. Specifically, FSA Guidance document 1-LFP Amendment 6 (https://www.fsa.u=
sda.gov/Internet/FSA_File/1lfp-a6.pdf<https://nam04.safelinks.protection.ou=
tlook.com/?url=3Dhttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.fsa.usda.gov%2FInternet%2FFSA_File%2F1lf=
p-a6.pdf&data=3D05%7C02%7Ckyle.bocinsky%40umontana.edu%7C4e59803e12c54fdab1=
e808ddc52a34fc%7C68407ce503da49ffaf0a724be0d37c9d%7C0%7C0%7C638883507447797=
006%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlA=
iOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=3Dm3AnWDk4=
eQ7kxCNZv8cy1zjFR%2F530voMeJ4lSlWusrY%3D&reserved=3D0>) Paragraph 23B indic=
ates, "The National Office will notify State and County Offices eligible fo=
r LFP by posting a list of eligible counties by pasture type every Thursday=
 at [https://usdagcc.sharepoint.com/sites/FPAC-FSA-FPAC-FSA-LFPStateProgram=
Specialists/LFP %20Eligibility%20Reports/Forms/AllItems.aspx] under "LFP El=
igible Counties"."

The LFP Eligible Counties Report contains the following columns: - State - =
County - Program Year - Pasture Type - D2 Qualifying Drought Start and End =
Dates (duration of 8 consecutive weeks) - D3a Qualifying Drought Start and =
End Dates (duration of 1 day) - D3b Qualifying Drought Start and End Dates =
(duration of 4 non-consecutive weeks) - D4a Qualifying Drought Start and En=
d Dates (duration of 1 day) - D4b Qualifying Drought Start and End Dates (d=
uration of 4 non-consecutive weeks)
- Date of Qualifying Drought - Drought Factor - Grazing Period Start and En=
d Dates - Maximum Eligible Payment Months - Payment Factor.

I would like to access a verbatim copy of that table, in Excel or CSV tabul=
ar format, for all program years (I believe it should be 2008=96present) (D=
ate Range for Record Search: From 1/1/2008 To 7/15/2025)=94

Your request is being handled under the provisions of the Freedom of Inform=
ation Act (FOIA), 5 U.S.C. =A7 552 (http://www.usdoj.gov/oip/amended-foia-r=
edlined.pdf<https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=3Dhttp%3A%2=
F%2Fwww.usdoj.gov%2Foip%2Famended-foia-redlined.pdf&data=3D05%7C02%7Ckyle.b=
ocinsky%40umontana.edu%7C4e59803e12c54fdab1e808ddc52a34fc%7C68407ce503da49f=
faf0a724be0d37c9d%7C0%7C0%7C638883507447822810%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJF=
bXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIld=
UIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=3Dt2FkPkHWUWb5ZxeIt5ZaLZBekGgwjoeVPp1AzHP7=
Ksc%3D&reserved=3D0>).

We process requests on a first-in, first-out basis.  The actual processing =
time will depend upon the complexity of the request and whether or not it i=
nvolves sensitive or voluminous records, or extensive searches and/or consu=
ltations.  We also process requests on a multi-track basis.  This means tha=
t simple requests, requiring minimal effort to respond, are processed in on=
e track, and more voluminous and complex requests are processed in another =
track.  We have placed your request in the Simple track.

Request 2025-FSA-08422-F is perfected and has been moved from pending into =
the Simple processing track.

This request has been placed in the =93Educational Use=94 Request Category =
and all fees will be waived.

The estimated date upon which we expect to provide you the requested record=
s is on or before: Augusst 14, 2025.

If you have questions concerning this request, please contact Government In=
formation (GI) Specialist Carol Nagel at 701-530-2107. If GI Specialist Car=
ol Nagel is not available, please contact GI Specialist Christina Vander Li=
nden at 816-823-2669, or GI Specialist Hani Nguyen at 763-388-0490. We can =
also be reached at the group e-mail address SM.FP.FOIA@usda.gov<mailto:SM.F=
P.FOIA@usda.gov>.

I appreciate the opportunity to assist you in this matter.

Sincerely,

Patrick McLoughlin
Patrick McLoughlin
FOIA Officer
Farm Production and Conservation





